  "releaseNotes": "BioLib 4.3.0 improves OME-Zarr integration and package deployment:\n- Replaces the local ZarrNET assembly reference with the published ZarrNET 0.8.1 package for reproducible builds and deployment.\n- Adds support for opening OME-Zarr 0.6 scene roots through ZarrNET's automatic multiscale-image dispatch.\n- Includes ZarrNET fixes for byDimension coordinate transformations and parallel Blosc block decoding.",
